WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.472
This query creates a clean preview view.

00:00:03.472 --> 00:00:09.392
Names, emails, phones, and addresses are transformed into candidate analytical fields.

00:00:09.392 --> 00:00:12.687
The original customer rows remain unchanged.

00:00:12.687 --> 00:00:18.987
This gives you a reusable prepared layer while keeping the source available for comparison and audit.

00:00:18.987 --> 00:00:26.112
A quarantine pattern separates questionable records from trusted analytical output without deleting evidence.

00:00:26.112 --> 00:00:32.837
Views are useful for reusable cleaning logic because they let you expose a consistent cleaned representation

00:00:32.837 --> 00:00:35.392
while keeping raw source data intact.

00:00:35.392 --> 00:00:38.358
That improves reproducibility and auditability.
